    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"Bollinger Bands mean reversion failed on both stocks tested:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- MARA: strong downtrend, strategy caught falling knife repeatedly\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- KO: uptrend, strategy exited too early, missed gains\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Worse Sharpe AND worse drawdown than buy & hold in both cases\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Conclusion: Simple Bollinger Bands mean reversion\\n\",\n",
    "    \"without additional filters is not a viable standalone strategy.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The exit condition (price > SMA) is too aggressive on trending stocks.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Possible improvements:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Add trend filter (only trade when stock is in sideways market)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Use %B indicator instead of band touch\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Different exit condition\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"79e757655180fec1\"\n",
